      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Under study were complains related with digestion organs in practically healthy people who had not been subjected to abdominal operations. Selection of the healthy people was performed with the help of automatic screening. In 10-12% of the people who had no previous abdominal operations and who consulted with doctors for gastroenterological diseases there are many common disorders of functions of the digestion organs which should be taken into consideration in assessment of results of operative procedures."},
